 class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> span_last <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> span.<span class=\"me1\">last</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"span.last&lt;3&gt;(): \"</span>, span_last<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/dynamic_extent\"><span class=\"kw2647\">std::<span class=\"me2\">dynamic_extent</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> span_last_dynamic <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> span.<span class=\"me1\">last</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"span.last(2): \"</span>, span_last_dynamic<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> a<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"int a\"</span>, a<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    run<span class=\"br0\">(</span>a<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>int a[8]{ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, };\nspan: [8]{ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, };\nspan.last&lt;3&gt;(): [3]{ 6, 7, 8, };\nspan.last(2): [2]{ 7, 8, };</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/first\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>first</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a subspan consisting of the first <code>N</code> elements of the sequence <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/subspan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>subspan</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a subspan <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/span","title":"std::span"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::span<T,Extent>::last","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Obtains a span that is a view over the last Count elements of this span."},{"label":"Return value","note":"A span r that is a view over the last Count elements of *this, such that r.data() == this->data() + (this->size() - Count) && r.size() == Count."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"first","n